Date: Tue, 4 Aug 2026 08:10:20 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 4/4] Aperture: support metroid camera topology

[metroid/evo] Rebased onto lineage-23.2. Upstream replaced
androidx.camera.camera2.internal.CameraIdUtil with CameraCompatibilityFilter,
which was a context line in the import hunk; the existing import is kept (it is
still used by onCreate) and the seven new imports are added around it. The other
two files applied with offset only.

Applied after 0002-0004, which had already landed cleanly in this repo.

